1
00:00:10,664 --> 00:00:13,765
No seriously,
we need to talk to the professor.

2
00:00:14,096 --> 00:00:15,464
This isn't humanly possible.

3
00:00:15,489 --> 00:00:16,990
He should come try it himself.

4
00:00:17,015 --> 00:00:18,684
He wouldn't even get it done.

5
00:00:18,709 --> 00:00:20,976
So what exactly did you do today.

6
00:00:21,001 --> 00:00:22,503
Research...?

7
00:00:22,528 --> 00:00:23,974
Yeah, next.

8
00:00:23,999 --> 00:00:27,135
I literally stayed up all night
designing the whole PPT.

9
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:29,641
And the circuit you made
looked awful color-wise,

10
00:00:29,666 --> 00:00:31,914
- I redid everything.
- Are you saying my circuit sucked?

11
00:00:31,939 --> 00:00:33,440
No I didn't mean it like that.

12
00:00:33,465 --> 00:00:36,187
Yours was actually really… emotional.

13
00:00:36,359 --> 00:00:38,895
Like... modern art vibes.

14
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:41,022
- Artsy flair...?
- Are you mocking me?

15
00:00:41,047 --> 00:00:42,455
No, I just...

16
00:00:42,517 --> 00:00:44,052
You two seem to be having fun.

17
00:00:44,077 --> 00:00:45,445
Does this look fun to you?

18
00:00:45,445 --> 00:00:48,502
You don't see him mouthing off
to his amazing senior.

19
00:00:48,527 --> 00:00:50,588
Come on, he's kinda cute.

20
00:00:52,101 --> 00:00:54,244
Hey, this place looks nice, right?

21
00:00:54,269 --> 00:00:55,430
We should check it out next time.

22
00:00:55,455 --> 00:00:57,353
Yeah looks good.

23
00:01:00,072 --> 00:01:01,773
Hey where you going?

24
00:01:01,798 --> 00:01:02,689
What?

25
00:01:02,714 --> 00:01:04,174
You two go ahead and keep talking.

26
00:01:04,199 --> 00:01:05,541
I'll head out first.

27
00:01:06,017 --> 00:01:07,236
Sorry, sorry.

28
00:01:07,261 --> 00:01:08,971
You are working on the project
together right?

29
00:01:08,996 --> 00:01:10,397
We'll talk later.

30
00:01:10,422 --> 00:01:11,861
I'm heading out.

31
00:01:12,097 --> 00:01:13,599
See you around.

32
00:01:18,445 --> 00:01:19,446
Must be nice huh.

33
00:01:19,446 --> 00:01:20,299
Nice my ass.

34
00:01:20,324 --> 00:01:21,676
Let's just finish this thing.

35
00:01:30,548 --> 00:01:31,549
Bro..

36
00:01:31,574 --> 00:01:33,376
Where am I supposed to sit
if you sprawl like that.

37
00:01:33,401 --> 00:01:37,104
You start on the floor, punk.

38
00:01:37,564 --> 00:01:38,955
What'd I even do so wrong.

39
00:01:38,980 --> 00:01:42,439
Hmm… being stuck in the same group as me.

40
00:01:43,338 --> 00:01:44,471
Let's just get this over with.

41
00:01:44,471 --> 00:01:46,299
I just wanna finish this and go home.

42
00:01:58,942 --> 00:02:01,330
I almost cried doing this problem.

43
00:02:01,754 --> 00:02:03,289
Seriously, that made you cry?

44
00:02:03,314 --> 00:02:05,916
For someone with only a soft
liberal arts brain like me,

45
00:02:05,941 --> 00:02:07,486
it's pain.

46
00:02:07,632 --> 00:02:09,963
That's not pain, that's ignorance.

47
00:02:10,786 --> 00:02:12,254
- Bro.
- Yeah?

48
00:02:12,279 --> 00:02:13,814
You're totally clueless about dating, huh?

49
00:02:13,839 --> 00:02:15,510
What are you talking about?

50
00:02:15,747 --> 00:02:17,361
Or are you just eunuch...

51
00:02:20,740 --> 00:02:23,209
Hey—hey hey hey hey.

52
00:02:23,209 --> 00:02:24,572
Sorry, sorry.

53
00:02:24,597 --> 00:02:26,158
My bad. I'm sorry.

54
00:02:26,328 --> 00:02:28,517
Let's just finish the research part now.

55
00:02:29,867 --> 00:02:31,463
Ugh...

56
00:02:33,265 --> 00:02:34,830
Get up.

57
00:02:35,424 --> 00:02:37,275
I think...

58
00:02:37,300 --> 00:02:39,549
we need to clear our heads a bit.

59
00:02:39,574 --> 00:02:40,575
From what?

60
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:42,611
Just five minutes.

61
00:02:42,770 --> 00:02:44,767
Can we meditate for like five minutes.

62
00:02:44,797 --> 00:02:46,666
Cool down the body and soul.

63
00:02:46,666 --> 00:02:48,001
Then dive back in.

64
00:02:48,001 --> 00:02:49,963
Just say you wanna nap.

65
00:02:50,101 --> 00:02:52,447
Fine, wake me up in thirty then.

66
00:02:55,721 --> 00:02:57,810
Guess I'll do it myself.

67
00:03:08,855 --> 00:03:10,760
(looking for girlfriend →
How about me? (clingy))

68
00:03:10,785 --> 00:03:12,767
(no flirting in the student lounge
final exams)

69
00:03:35,168 --> 00:03:38,204
- Aah!!
- What what what!! What is it!

70
00:03:38,229 --> 00:03:42,103
Dude! That... is that even a person?

71
00:03:42,128 --> 00:03:43,331
I… I dunno!

72
00:03:43,356 --> 00:03:44,457
That's blood right there.

73
00:03:44,457 --> 00:03:45,885
Is that… is he dead?

74
00:03:45,910 --> 00:03:46,994
W-wait, hold on.

75
00:03:47,026 --> 00:03:48,027
We...

76
00:03:48,027 --> 00:03:49,772
We... need to call the cops first.

77
00:03:49,797 --> 00:03:51,966
- Where is your phone?
- Phone.

78
00:03:52,131 --> 00:03:53,433
Phone!

79
00:03:54,357 --> 00:03:55,825
Here here here it is.

80
00:03:55,850 --> 00:03:57,552
Why is it off?

81
00:03:57,577 --> 00:03:59,379
Why is it dead now of all times?

82
00:03:59,404 --> 00:04:01,260
Do you even charge this thing!?

83
00:04:01,285 --> 00:04:02,750
How was I supposed to know
this would happen?

84
00:04:02,775 --> 00:04:04,010
What are we gonna do now?!

85
00:04:04,010 --> 00:04:06,244
Why are you asking me that?

86
00:04:06,955 --> 00:04:07,884
Hey, hey.

87
00:04:07,909 --> 00:04:08,410
Hey?

88
00:04:08,448 --> 00:04:09,449
Your phone, your phone.

89
00:04:09,449 --> 00:04:11,096
- M-my pho—
- Yours.

90
00:04:11,121 --> 00:04:12,681
Got it got it right here.

91
00:04:25,111 --> 00:04:27,767
"Don't Confess Next a Corpse"
